            "tender": {
                "id": "tender_420287/1357701",
                "title": "Internet of Things Standards Consultancy Support",
                "description": "The Requirement \r\n\r\nTo ensure effective delivery, DSIT requires a consultant with experience developing standards and registration to the relevant committees (TC CYBER) to assist with the update of ETSI EN 303 645. This will include: \r\n\r\nAttending ETSI TC CYBER meetings and events related to ETSI EN 303 645 \r\n\r\nProducing reports on activities related to the updating of ETSI EN 303 645 \r\n\r\nWork related to the transition of ETSI EN 303 645 in between meetings, including secretariat support and drafting technical text. \r\n\r\nThese activities will require the supplier to be a credible technical expert within the relevant committees with expertise in cyber security and/or IoT. The supplier will need to be active member of SDOs, and have a working level understanding of relevant work being undertaken across the standards landscape.",
